  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Highway Modernization S. Paulo-Florianopolis</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Modernizacin Carretera S. Paulo-Florianopolis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT CONSIST IN THE MODERNIZATION AND WIDENING OF THE FOLLOWING FEDERAL HIGHWAYS, BR-116 SAO PAULO - CURITIBA SECTION (395KM), BR-376 AND BR-101 BETWEEN CURITIBA AND FLORIANOPOLIS IN THE SOUTHERN REGION OF BRASIL. IT IS ALSO FORSEEN TO IMPLEMENT A COST RECOVERY MECHANISM (TOLLS) AND THE PRIVATE SECTOR PARTICIPATION IN TERMS OF CONCESIONS CONTRACTS. PROJECT IS LOCATED IN THE STATES OF SAO PAULO, PARANA AND SANTA CATARINA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
